  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/56eunZh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"308\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為 L_Ender's Cataclysm 模組新增的熾焱武器</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><strong>需求：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a></span></strong></span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\">必須安裝才能使用此擴充模組！</span></strong></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000;text-decoration:underline\">可</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">在 Aternos 伺服器上使用！</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">此模組為遊戲中的熾焱礦石新增了可製作的武器，例如劍、鎬等...</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252ftcoD4tL\" rel=\"nofollow\">全新 3D 模型<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tcoD4tL.gif\" width=\"405\" height=\"386\">此為新鋤頭模型的 GIF 動畫範例</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">劍、鎬、斧、鏟和鋤的全新模型！</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
